<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MyChart AI — Investor Pitch</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
:root{
  --bg:#08090c;
  --surface:#0f1116;
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  --text:#ecedf0;
  --muted:rgba(236,237,240,.4);
  --faint:rgba(236,237,240,.07);
  --red:#ff4d5a;
  --teal:#00ddb8;
  --blue:#4d8cff;
  --gold:#a78bfa;
  --syne:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;
  --body:'DM Sans',sans-serif;
  --mono:'DM Mono',monospace;
}
html,body{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--body);}

/* ── DECK CONTAINER ── */
#deck{position:fixed;inset:0;overflow:hidden;}

/* ── SLIDE ── */
.slide{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;
  padding:5vh 6vw;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;
  transition:opacity .55s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1), transform .55s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
  transform:translateY(32px);
  will-change:opacity,transform;
}
.slide.active{opacity:1;pointer-events:all;transform:translateY(0);}
.slide.exit-up{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-32px);}
.slide.exit-down{opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);}

/* ── BACKGROUNDS ── */
.bg-cover{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;overflow:hidden;}
.bg-cover canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;}
.slide-content{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;max-width:1100px;}

/* ── NAV ── */
#nav{
  position:fixed;bottom:2.5rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;
}
.nav-dots{display:flex;gap:.55rem;align-items:center;}
.dot{
  width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.2);cursor:pointer;
  transition:all .25s;border:none;padding:0;
}
.dot.active{background:#fff;width:22px;border-radius:3px;}
.nav-btn{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--muted);background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:.5rem 1.1rem;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .18s;
}
.nav-btn:hover{color:var(--text);background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);}

/* ── SLIDE COUNTER ── */
#counter{
  position:fixed;top:2rem;right:2.5rem;z-index:100;
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--muted);
}

/* ── PROGRESS BAR ── */
#progress{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:2px;z-index:100;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--teal),var(--blue));
  transition:width .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);
}

/* ────────────────────────────────────────────
   SLIDE 0 — COVER
──────────────────────────────────────────── */
#s0 .eyebrow{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:1.6rem;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;
}
#s0 .eyebrow::before{content:'';display:block;width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--teal);}
#s0 h1{
  font-family:var(--syne);font-size:clamp(3.2rem,8vw,7rem);font-weight:800;
  line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-bottom:2rem;
}
#s0 h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--teal);}
#s0 .tagline{
  font-size:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.3rem);font-weight:300;color:var(--muted);
  max-width:560px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:3rem;
}
#s0 .meta{display:flex;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}
#s0 .meta-item{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);}
#s0 .meta-item strong{display:block;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:0;font-family:var(--syne);font-weight:600;margin-top:.2rem;}
.cover-rule{width:100%;height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:2rem 0;}

/* ────────────────────────────────────────────
   SHARED SLIDE PARTS
──────────────────────────────────────────── */
.slide-label{
  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;
}
.slide-label::before{content:'';display:block;width:20px;height:1px;}
.label-red .slide-label{color:var(--red);}
.label-red .slide-label::before{background:var(--red);}
.label-teal .slide-label{color:var(--teal);}
.label-teal .slide-label::before{background:var(--teal);}
.label-blue .slide-label{color:var(--blue);}
.label-blue .slide-label::before{background:var(--blue);}
.label-gold .slide-label{color:var(--gold);}
.label-gold .slide-label::before{background:var(--gold);}

.slide-h2{
  font-family:var(--syne);font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3.6rem);font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1rem;
}
.slide-sub{font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;max-width:580px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;}

/* ── GRID LAYOUTS ── */
.grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem;}
.grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;}
.grid-4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;}

/* ── CARDS ── */
.card{
  background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;padding:1.25rem 1.35rem;
}
.card-accent-red  {border-top:2px solid var(--red);}
.card-accent-teal {border-top:2px solid var(--teal);}
.card-accent-blue {border-top:2px solid var(--blue);}
.card-accent-gold {border-top:2px solid var(--gold);}
.card-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;}
.card-title{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.5rem;}
.card-body{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);}
.card-stat{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1;margin-top:.75rem;}

/* ── STAT TILES ── */
.stat-tile{
  background:var(--faint);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;
  padding:1.2rem 1.25rem;text-align:center;
}
.stat-tile .val{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.6rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1;display:block;margin-bottom:.4rem;}
.stat-tile .lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);}

/* ── QUOTE ── */
.pull-quote{
  border-left:3px solid var(--teal);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;
  background:rgba(0,221,184,.04);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;
  font-size:clamp(.95rem,1.6vw,1.15rem);line-height:1.7;font-weight:300;
  font-style:italic;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}
.pull-quote cite{display:block;margin-top:.6rem;font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);}

/* ── TWO-COL SPLIT ── */
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3vw;align-items:start;}
.split-left{}
.split-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;}

/* ── NUMBERED LIST ── */
.num-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.85rem;}
.num-item{display:flex;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start;}
.num{
  font-family:var(--syne);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:800;
  min-width:2rem;height:2rem;border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:.1rem;
}
.num-body .nt{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.2rem;}
.num-body .nd{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;}

/* ── TIMELINE ── */
.timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
.tl-row{display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:flex-start;padding:.9rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--faint);}
.tl-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.tl-marker{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding-top:.25rem;}
.tl-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid;flex-shrink:0;}
.tl-line{width:1px;flex:1;background:var(--border);margin-top:4px;min-height:24px;}
.tl-ph{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.2rem .55rem;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:.15rem;}
.ph-1{background:rgba(77,140,255,.12);color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(77,140,255,.2);}
.ph-2{background:rgba(0,221,184,.1);color:var(--teal);border:1px solid rgba(0,221,184,.18);}
.ph-3{background:rgba(168,85,247,.1);color:#c084fc;border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.18);}
.ph-4{background:rgba(245,200,66,.1);color:var(--gold);border:1px solid rgba(245,200,66,.18);}
.tl-content .tt{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.2rem;}
.tl-content .td{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;}

/* ── AUDIENCE CARDS ── */
.aud-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;}
.aud{border-radius:8px;padding:1rem 1.15rem;background:var(--faint);border:1px solid var(--border);}
.aud-who{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.35rem;}
.aud-msg{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:.35rem;font-style:italic;}
.aud-ch{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);}

/* ── KPI TABLE ── */
.kpi-group{margin-bottom:1.25rem;}
.kpi-group-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;padding-bottom:.35rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--faint);}
.kpi-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.03);}
.kpi-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.kpi-label{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);}
.kpi-val{font-family:var(--syne);font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;}

/* ── CLOSING ── */
#s10 .big-statement{
  font-family:var(--syne);font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4.2rem);font-weight:800;
  line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:2rem;
}
#s8 .big-statement em{font-style:normal;color:var(--teal);}
.cta-block{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.cta-btn{
  font-family:var(--syne);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;
  padding:.85rem 2rem;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;border:none;transition:all .2s;
}
.cta-primary{background:var(--teal);color:#08090c;}
.cta-primary:hover{background:#00f5cc;}
.cta-secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);}
.cta-secondary:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);}

/* ── ANIMATED ENTRY ── */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .5s ease,transform .5s ease;}
.slide.active .reveal{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.slide.active .reveal:nth-child(1){transition-delay:.05s;}
.slide.active .reveal:nth-child(2){transition-delay:.15s;}
.slide.active .reveal:nth-child(3){transition-delay:.25s;}
.slide.active .reveal:nth-child(4){transition-delay:.35s;}
.slide.active .reveal:nth-child(5){transition-delay:.45s;}

/* ── GRAIN ── */
body::after{
  content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:200;pointer-events:none;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noise'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noise)' opacity='0.035'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
  opacity:.4;
}

/* ── MOBILE ── */
@media(max-width:700px){
  .grid-2,.grid-3,.grid-4,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  #s0 h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,11vw,4rem);}
  .slide-h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,7vw,2.6rem);}
  .slide{padding:4vh 5vw 8vh;}
  #nav{bottom:1.5rem;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="progress"></div>
<div id="counter"></div>

<!-- BACKGROUND CANVAS -->
<canvas id="bg" style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;width:100%;height:100%;"></canvas>

<div id="deck">

<!-- ─────────────── SLIDE 0: COVER ─────────────── -->
<section class="slide active" id="s0">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">Healthcare AI Infrastructure</div>
    <h1 class="reveal">The Data<br>Exists.<br><em>Make it Think.</em></h1>
    <p class="tagline reveal">MyChart AI adds an intelligence layer to Epic's existing infrastructure — so physicians spend less time processing records and more time treating patients.</p>
    <div class="cover-rule reveal"></div>
    <div class="meta reveal">
      <div class="meta-item">Company<strong>MyChart AI</strong></div>
      <div class="meta-item">Stage<strong>Seed / Series A</strong></div>
      <div class="meta-item">Market<strong>$89.3B by 2034</strong></div>
      <div class="meta-item">Built On<strong>Epic + TEFCA</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────── SLIDE 1: PROBLEM ─────────────── -->
<section class="slide label-red" id="s1">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-label reveal">01 — The Problem</div>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">Healthcare has the data.<br>No one can read it.</h2>
    <p class="slide-sub reveal">Clinical records are distributed across more than 50 discrete EHR platforms with no interoperability layer capable of synthesis at the point of care. The resulting fragmentation drives measurable degradation in both provider efficiency and patient outcomes.</p>
    <div class="grid-3 reveal">
      <div class="card card-accent-red">
        <div class="card-label">Finding 01</div>
        <div class="card-title">Record Fragmentation</div>
        <div class="card-body">Patient histories are distributed across Epic, Cerner, Athena, and regional systems with no unified longitudinal view accessible during clinical encounters.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--red)">1–2 hrs</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.3rem;">estimated per-shift retrieval burden</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent-red">
        <div class="card-label">Finding 02</div>
        <div class="card-title">Physician Burnout</div>
        <div class="card-body">EHR documentation overhead is the primary correlate of physician burnout — not clinical volume. Administrative burden directly constrains system-wide capacity.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--red)">56%</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.3rem;">of physicians attribute burnout to EHR burden</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent-red">
        <div class="card-label">Finding 03</div>
        <div class="card-title">Redundant Expenditure</div>
        <div class="card-body">Absence of cross-system record access drives duplicate diagnostic testing and redundant administrative workflows, producing quantifiable and avoidable annual losses.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--red)">$8.3B</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.3rem;">estimated annual administrative waste (US)</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────── SLIDE 2: WHY NOW ─────────────── -->
<section class="slide label-gold" id="s2">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-label reveal">02 — Why Now</div>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">The infrastructure is live.<br>The intelligence gap remains open.</h2>
    <div class="split reveal">
      <div class="split-left">
        <p class="slide-sub" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Trusted Exchange Framework and Common Agreement (TEFCA) established in 2024 creates, for the first time, a federated query capability across more than 500 million patient records. The technical preconditions for cross-system clinical intelligence are now satisfied. What the ecosystem lacks is an analytical synthesis layer capable of operating on this infrastructure at the point of care.</p>
        <div class="pull-quote">
          "California physicians receive patient records from connected health networks but have no intelligent layer to make sense of them. The data exists — it simply does not speak. MyChart sits at the center of this infrastructure already. This proposal makes it think."
          <cite>— MyChart AI Core Positioning Statement, 2025</cite>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:0;">
          <div class="stat-tile">
            <span class="val" style="color:var(--gold)">500M+</span>
            <span class="lbl">TEFCA records live (2026)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-tile">
            <span class="val" style="color:var(--gold)">$89.3B</span>
            <span class="lbl">Patient engagement market by 2034</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split-right">
        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="tl-row">
            <div class="tl-marker"><div class="tl-dot" style="border-color:var(--blue)"></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem;flex:1;">
              <span class="tl-ph ph-1">2024</span>
              <div class="tl-content"><div class="tt">TEFCA Goes Live</div><div class="td">Federal network of networks enables cross-system queries across 500M+ patient records for the first time.</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-row">
            <div class="tl-marker"><div class="tl-dot" style="border-color:var(--teal)"></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem;flex:1;">
              <span class="tl-ph ph-2">2025</span>
              <div class="tl-content"><div class="tt">Epic AI Suite Matures</div><div class="td">Art, Emmie, and ambient documentation hit 1M draft notes/month. Infrastructure is proven at 150 health systems.</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-row">
            <div class="tl-marker"><div class="tl-dot" style="border-color:#c084fc)"></div></div>
            <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.3rem;flex:1;">
              <span class="tl-ph ph-3">2026</span>
              <div class="tl-content"><div class="tt">Intelligence Layer Opens</div><div class="td">The missing piece: a synthesis layer that reads the data and surfaces what matters, when it matters. That's MyChart AI.</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────── SLIDE 3: SOLUTION ─────────────── -->
<section class="slide label-teal" id="s3">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-label reveal">03 — The Solution</div>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">An intelligence layer<br>embedded in existing clinical workflows.</h2>
    <p class="slide-sub reveal">MyChart AI does not displace Epic — it activates it. By operating natively within the existing EHR environment, the platform eliminates adoption friction while delivering cross-network synthesis, automated documentation, longitudinal risk modeling, and patient-facing care continuity at scale.</p>
    <div class="grid-4 reveal">
      <div class="card card-accent-teal">
        <div class="card-label">Feature 01</div>
        <div class="card-title">Record Synthesis</div>
        <div class="card-body">Pulls from TEFCA, Carequality, and CommonWell into a unified patient view in seconds.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--teal);font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;">&lt;3 sec</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.25rem;">cross-system pull time</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent-teal">
        <div class="card-label">Feature 02</div>
        <div class="card-title">AI Chart Drafting</div>
        <div class="card-body">Epic Art captures encounters via ambient listening and generates structured draft notes for physician review.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--teal);font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;">1M+</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.25rem;">drafts generated per month</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent-teal">
        <div class="card-label">Feature 03</div>
        <div class="card-title">Risk Detection</div>
        <div class="card-body">Cosmos CoMET models trained on 118M patients flag longitudinal risk signals before they become diagnoses.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--teal);font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;">118M</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.25rem;">patient training dataset</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-accent-teal">
        <div class="card-label">Feature 04</div>
        <div class="card-title">Emmie AI</div>
        <div class="card-body">Patient concierge that translates clinical visits into plain language, answers questions, and closes care gaps 24/7.</div>
        <div class="card-stat" style="color:var(--teal);font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:.6rem;">24/7</div>
        <div class="card-label" style="margin-top:.25rem;">HIPAA-compliant patient AI</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────────── SLIDE 4: COMPETITIVE ADVANTAGE ─────────────── -->
<section class="slide label-teal" id="s4">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="slide-label reveal">04 — Defensibility</div>
    <h2 class="slide-h2 reveal">No displacement required.<br>No new workflow to learn.</h2>
    <div class="split reveal">
      <div class="split-left">
        <p class="slide-sub" style="margin-bottom:1.75rem;">Competing solutions require either full EHR migration or siloed point-solution integration — both of which impose significant institutional friction and change management burden. MyChart AI is architected natively on Epic, Microsoft Azure, and HL7 FHIR R4, eliminating integration overhead for the 96% of major US health systems already operating on Epic.</p>
